State contract:

```json
{
  "deployment_mode": "single",
  "base_image": "...",
  "services": [{"name": "main", "image_or_build": "...", "ports": [], "healthcheck": "..."}],
  "dependencies": {"system": [], "language": [], "pinned": true},
